  races a GH Actions write-visibility lag before the script's poll+`mv` step. Fix: pass the
  final filename directly via `pack`'s second positional arg, eliminating the race by
  construction. Plan at `~/.claude/plans/shimmering-wibbling-frost.md`; implemented as PR #104
  on `feature/mcpb-pack-race` — core fix landed and CI-green, but pinning `@anthropic-ai/mcpb`
  as a devDependency (to prevent future silent CLI-behavior drift) pulled in the CLI's own
  vulnerable transitive deps (`tmp`, plus re-triggering `postcss`/`@hono/node-server`). An
